# CQ4: 哪些商家的品牌授权书将在 N 天内到期 → 影响在售商品的续权预警
PREFIX :    <https://demo.local/ecat#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
SELECT ?merchant ?auth ?exp WHERE {
  ?merchant :holdsAuthorization ?auth .
  ?auth :validUntil ?exp .
  FILTER(?exp > "$AS_OF"^^xsd:date && ?exp <= "$AS_OF_PLUS_AUTH"^^xsd:date)
}
